WEBVTT

00:00.008 --> 00:01.166
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.167 --> 00:02.476
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION, BINGE
DRINKING, SHAMEFUL ACTS NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:02.477 --> 00:03.756
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:03.757 --> 00:04.987
DUE TO RECENT COMPLIANCE ISSUES, THE
BLACK DOT SIZE HAS BEEN INCREASED BY 5%.

00:16.127 --> 00:18.546
<i>Let's go take a trip
under the bright summer sun</i>

00:18.547 --> 00:21.796
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 3<i>To a city far away, what do you say?</i>

00:21.797 --> 00:24.176
<i>Let's go take a trip
under the bright summer sun</i>

00:24.177 --> 00:27.727
<i>To a city far away, what do you say?</i>

00:31.847 --> 00:33.686
<i>Wait a sec, another heatwave?</i>

00:33.687 --> 00:35.436
<i>Temperatures are rising... Huh?!</i>

00:35.437 --> 00:38.646
<i>Our original plans are
totally busted, what now?</i>

00:38.647 --> 00:41.446
<i>But honestly, I'm getting so hyped</i>

00:41.447 --> 00:44.116
<i>Alright, let's roll up
our sleeves and dive in</i>

00:44.117 --> 00:45.906
<i>Rub your sleepy eyes and jump up</i>

00:45.907 --> 00:47.326
<i>Grab the usual shades</i>

00:47.327 --> 00:50.246
<i>Check your gear: Iced coffee, thermos</i>

00:50.247 --> 00:52.916
<i>Clear blue skies, just a trick of summer</i>

00:52.917 --> 00:56.047
<i>The booming speakers
keep calling my name</i>

00:56.417 --> 00:58.917
<i>Even now, I still believe</i>

01:01.837 --> 01:03.796
<i>In unexpected encounters</i>

01:03.797 --> 01:06.346
<i>And the miracles of this season</i>

01:06.347 --> 01:09.636
<i>Summer brings
those swing swing emotions</i>

01:09.637 --> 01:12.386
<i>Ah, even if I get a little carried away</i>

01:12.387 --> 01:17.566
<i>On my mind,
I've only been searching for you</i>

01:17.567 --> 01:23.526
<i>Let the south wind blow you here,
just as you are</i>

01:23.527 --> 01:28.237
<i>Under the blue sky, hold me tight</i>

01:29.037 --> 01:34.497
<i>I want to dream
a summer dream with you</i>

01:37.457 --> 01:39.957
SISCON BROTHER

01:40.177 --> 01:42.376
I'll leave that guy to you.

01:42.377 --> 01:43.977
What are you talking about?

01:44.147 --> 01:46.276
How am I supposed to stop him.

01:46.277 --> 01:47.607
Don't say that.

01:48.007 --> 01:50.637
Technically,
you count as a "little sister" too.

01:50.947 --> 01:53.937
You think I should call
Imamura "big brother"!?

01:54.727 --> 01:57.227
LOVE FOR SISTER

01:58.727 --> 02:00.247
UNEXPECTEDLY BEAUTIFUL BREASTS

02:03.407 --> 02:06.117
Chisa, this is a bit hard to say.

02:06.377 --> 02:08.907
But it seems you aren't up to standards.

02:09.547 --> 02:12.117
Somehow hearing that
really pisses me off.

02:18.559 --> 02:20.676
Drinking beer on a train is truly the best.

02:20.677 --> 02:21.676
Alright, alright.

02:21.677 --> 02:23.817
It fits with a bento box,
you should have one too...

02:25.317 --> 02:26.407
What's wrong?

02:26.557 --> 02:28.596
Ah no, I think I'm a bit drunk.

02:28.597 --> 02:29.007
Huh?

02:29.157 --> 02:30.277
But you just had beer.

02:32.500 --> 02:34.320
Ugh!

02:34.507 --> 02:36.516
How did you not notice?

02:36.517 --> 02:39.107
It won't be good to go home this drunk.

02:39.427 --> 02:41.477
In that case,
why not drink some water?

02:42.467 --> 02:44.737
Let me go buy some for you.

02:46.758 --> 02:48.137
By the way, Kitahara.

02:48.267 --> 02:48.857
Huh?

02:49.237 --> 02:52.487
You and Kotegawa aren't
blood-related, right?

02:52.597 --> 02:53.947
Ah, about that...

02:54.237 --> 02:56.286
My old man is adopted.

02:56.287 --> 02:57.226
You bastard!

02:57.497 --> 03:00.167
That girl looks better in
a mahou shoujo outfit!!

03:00.287 --> 03:01.376
Don't talk nonsense!!

03:01.377 --> 03:03.006
A hakama is more fitting!

03:03.007 --> 03:03.336
- Are they fighting?
- Sounds foreign.

03:03.337 --> 03:05.216
No! It has to be <i>mahou shoujo</i>!!
- Are they fighting? - Sounds foreign.

03:05.217 --> 03:05.716
No! It has to be <i>hakama</i>!!
- Are they fighting? - Sounds foreign.

03:05.717 --> 03:05.986
No! It has to be <i>hakama</i>!!

03:05.987 --> 03:07.126
They're bothering the wider public.
No! It has to be <i>hakama</i>!!

03:07.127 --> 03:07.797
They're bothering the wider public.

03:08.047 --> 03:09.996
I'll go give them a little warning.

03:09.997 --> 03:12.426
What if she hates you
for making her wear that?

03:12.427 --> 03:13.846
That's my line!

03:13.847 --> 03:15.677
You don't know how to escort a girl!

03:15.937 --> 03:18.307
Then I'll show you how it's done!

03:21.951 --> 03:23.306
What's wrong, Kitahara?

03:23.307 --> 03:24.237
Shh.

03:24.337 --> 03:25.776
Don't get involved.

03:25.777 --> 03:27.836
Best not to mess with those guys.

03:27.837 --> 03:29.156
- What exactly is...
- Stop!

03:29.157 --> 03:30.817
There will be no turning back.

03:31.097 --> 03:34.197
Just stay quiet, hold your breath
and they'll quiet down soon.

03:34.387 --> 03:35.657
Really?

03:37.190 --> 03:37.965
See?

03:44.317 --> 03:45.256
What's wrong?

03:45.257 --> 03:45.907
Kouhei.

03:47.007 --> 03:48.546
It's just the two of us here.

03:48.547 --> 03:50.637
There's no one else with us, understand?

03:50.867 --> 03:53.187
What the hell is going on?

03:53.367 --> 03:56.347
Well, my stomach hurts a bit
so I'm going to the restroom...

03:58.137 --> 03:58.807
Huh?

04:02.257 --> 04:04.437
This is my lover.

04:05.227 --> 04:06.986
Did you dare lay a hand on her!!

04:06.987 --> 04:10.356
If she's not pure anymore,
she won't be able to use magic!

04:10.357 --> 04:11.476
Wait! Wait! Wait! Wait!

04:11.477 --> 04:14.177
I have no idea what's happening,
but let's hear them out.

04:14.950 --> 04:16.746
Kouhei Imamura here will listen.

04:16.747 --> 04:18.246
Don't say such absurd things!

04:18.247 --> 04:19.156
Why not?

04:19.157 --> 04:21.746
They are tourists,
and it's our first time meeting.

04:21.747 --> 04:23.667
With my social skills, how could I...

04:31.927 --> 04:33.897
Phew, so that's settled.

04:34.637 --> 04:36.886
We have to find a way to
deal with that guy, right?

04:36.887 --> 04:39.477
Okay, okay, I think so.

04:39.767 --> 04:41.396
CEMENT
Go for it!

04:41.397 --> 04:41.906
CEMENT
Yeah!

04:41.907 --> 04:43.647
CEMENT
Why are you guys hitting it off?

04:43.767 --> 04:46.026
A guy like you doesn't deserve her!

04:46.027 --> 04:46.556
Exactly!

04:46.557 --> 04:49.107
- A guy like you is completely unworthy!
- <i>I don't understand what they're saying.</i>

04:49.447 --> 04:51.537
<i>I'll just express myself like Kouhei.</i>

04:51.959 --> 04:54.907
Okay, okay, I think so.

04:55.278 --> 04:56.012
Huh?

04:56.357 --> 04:58.907
Okay, okay.

05:01.367 --> 05:02.986
- Drink!
- Drink!

05:02.987 --> 05:04.167
Such discrimination!

05:04.955 --> 05:06.157
Hey, translate for me.

05:06.837 --> 05:08.576
Tell them we have no beef.

05:08.577 --> 05:10.257
How could I do that?

05:10.639 --> 05:11.872
Why not?

05:12.382 --> 05:15.256
Forget the topic, I don't even
recognise their language.

05:15.257 --> 05:17.747
Then how the hell are
you hitting it off with them?

05:18.077 --> 05:21.596
With this, you don't need to
know the language to understand.

05:21.597 --> 05:23.767
That makes sense, but...

05:24.257 --> 05:25.557
Hey, hey.

05:29.187 --> 05:32.236
Is this the apex of
Japanese alcohol tolerance?

05:32.237 --> 05:35.447
Needing water after just that much,
no wonder you ran away.

05:39.727 --> 05:42.906
I don't understand what you guys
are saying but bring it on.

05:42.907 --> 05:46.277
We members of PaB, even if we lose
at everything else in the world,

05:49.937 --> 05:53.127
will absolutely never lose
a drinking contest!

05:53.717 --> 05:56.717
NOT CARING

06:00.617 --> 06:01.857
<i>This alcohol...</i>

06:03.847 --> 06:04.806
Hey!

06:04.807 --> 06:06.226
Keep going.

06:06.227 --> 06:07.766
Not yet.

06:07.767 --> 06:09.227
This is just the beginning!

06:13.042 --> 06:14.277
What the hell are you doing?

06:16.847 --> 06:17.907
We are so sorry.

06:18.447 --> 06:21.366
These two are not right in the head.

06:21.367 --> 06:23.137
Hey, apologize.

06:23.357 --> 06:24.326
I'm so sorry...

06:24.327 --> 06:25.246
Sorry...

06:25.247 --> 06:26.407
I'm sorry.

06:26.537 --> 06:27.577
I'm really sorry.

06:35.407 --> 06:36.217
- Damn it.
- Tch.

06:36.407 --> 06:39.136
So what was that all about?

06:39.137 --> 06:42.557
Who knows,
they suddenly started talking to me.

06:42.747 --> 06:45.686
Probably just some
overly excited tourists.

06:45.687 --> 06:49.856
But just now, I also felt a little
sympathy for that woman.

06:49.857 --> 06:50.696
Huh?

06:50.697 --> 06:51.607
Why?

06:51.907 --> 06:55.737
Because she seemed to be having
a hard time dealing with those two idiots.

06:56.567 --> 06:58.027
I thought so too.

06:58.377 --> 06:59.237
Me too.

07:00.907 --> 07:01.906
Huh?

07:01.907 --> 07:04.956
Do you two think of yourselves
as normal people?

07:04.957 --> 07:06.996
That's what I would usually say!

07:06.997 --> 07:08.644
No, that's my catchphrase!

07:16.550 --> 07:18.695
They're almost here.

07:20.670 --> 07:23.533
All that's left is to find
a place to hide this.

07:24.867 --> 07:28.517
If you don't inherit the inn,
don't even dream of me giving it back.

07:29.676 --> 07:30.832
You awful brother.

07:31.317 --> 07:34.317
KITAHARA INN

07:34.627 --> 07:35.507
Welcome.

07:35.737 --> 07:38.107
Welcome to Kitahara Inn.

07:38.207 --> 07:40.677
It's been a while, uncle and aunt.

07:40.897 --> 07:42.807
Chisa, long time no see.

07:43.007 --> 07:44.807
You've grown so much.

07:45.177 --> 07:47.247
Is that Iori's friend?

07:47.387 --> 07:50.377
No, my name is Kouhei Imamura.

07:50.527 --> 07:52.997
And I am Shiori's biological brother!

07:53.647 --> 07:55.457
Hey, you!

07:55.637 --> 07:58.110
Why are you sowing discord in my family?

07:58.207 --> 07:59.736
I didn't mean to.

07:59.737 --> 08:02.256
Not having malicious intent
makes it even worse!

08:02.257 --> 08:03.317
Honey.

08:03.778 --> 08:05.510
Don't worry, I will never accept him.

08:05.597 --> 08:06.476
Old man!

08:06.477 --> 08:08.767
How could you say
taboo thoughts like that?

08:08.997 --> 08:11.147
So what's the truth?

08:11.407 --> 08:14.667
He's a friend... from the same club.

08:14.977 --> 08:16.417
Well, whatever.

08:16.537 --> 08:18.337
That's not the issue here.

08:18.567 --> 08:20.737
Mom, where is my passport?

08:20.887 --> 08:23.527
Huh? I don't know anything about it.

08:23.807 --> 08:26.007
I think Shiori took it.

08:27.387 --> 08:29.937
Shiori, could you bring me my passport?

08:30.187 --> 08:32.457
Abso... lutely... not.

08:32.897 --> 08:36.296
But I have to go to Palau next week.

08:36.297 --> 08:37.837
You don't need to.

08:38.167 --> 08:40.597
Because you'll be staying here...

08:40.747 --> 08:42.216
for the rest of your life!

08:42.217 --> 08:44.427
You're really scary sometimes.

08:45.834 --> 08:47.451
What should I do for you to return it?

08:47.977 --> 08:52.056
If you return to a normal life,
don't neglect the business,

08:52.057 --> 08:54.976
and do what you're supposed to do,
then I'll return it.

08:54.977 --> 08:57.357
None of that is specific at all!

08:57.657 --> 08:59.896
Instead, I'll give this guy to you.

08:59.897 --> 09:02.507
Shiori-chan, it's big brother Kouhei.

09:02.727 --> 09:06.197
Big sister Chisa, how about you go
take a bath in the hot spring first?

09:06.297 --> 09:07.846
Ah, I'd love to.

09:07.847 --> 09:09.537
I'm all sweaty from the trip anyway.

09:09.697 --> 09:12.167
Shiori, is there anything you want?

09:12.297 --> 09:13.207
No, thank you.

09:13.447 --> 09:14.477
A DSLR camera.

09:14.677 --> 09:16.076
An outstanding son.

09:16.077 --> 09:17.707
Nobody asked for your opinions!

09:17.987 --> 09:22.057
Well then big sister Chisa,
I've left the towels over there for you.

09:22.647 --> 09:24.056
Take your time.

09:24.057 --> 09:26.427
Hey, Shiori.

09:26.607 --> 09:27.556
Damn!

09:27.557 --> 09:29.557
There's barely any days left.

09:30.357 --> 09:31.936
This is not good.

09:31.937 --> 09:34.856
A stubborn little sister also has
her own cute charm.

09:34.857 --> 09:36.877
How can I get her to return it.

09:38.418 --> 09:40.486
Beg her with all your honest heart.

09:40.487 --> 09:42.696
Or do good deeds to score points.

09:42.697 --> 09:44.907
In short, you have to win her over.

09:45.197 --> 09:46.906
Quickly get it over quick.

09:46.907 --> 09:48.157
You're in a hurry, right?

09:48.627 --> 09:50.996
Is it really necessary to go that far?

09:50.997 --> 09:51.836
Huh?

09:51.837 --> 09:52.787
Kitahara?

09:53.177 --> 09:56.496
She's just sulking
and acting spoiled.

09:56.497 --> 09:58.776
But you have to understand
her feelings too.

09:58.777 --> 10:00.177
Like I give a damn.

10:00.657 --> 10:02.717
I have my own reasons too.

10:03.193 --> 10:05.177
As her older brother,
I must set things straight.

10:13.727 --> 10:13.906
LARGE PUBLIC BATH

10:13.907 --> 10:14.976
That's enough, Shiori!
LARGE PUBLIC BATH

10:14.977 --> 10:15.577
That's enough, Shiori!

10:16.727 --> 10:18.847
I told you I'd lick your shoes!

10:20.607 --> 10:22.607
KITAHARA INN

10:24.927 --> 10:26.937
I just set things straight with her.

10:27.037 --> 10:29.677
If you think that's fine, then whatever.

10:30.147 --> 10:31.506
What about the passport?

10:31.507 --> 10:34.617
Mentally,
consider it already in my hands.

10:34.937 --> 10:37.726
Unfortunately,
a passport is a physical object.

10:37.727 --> 10:38.977
Exactly.

10:39.387 --> 10:42.941
So I plan to sneak into Shiori's room
and steal it.

10:43.567 --> 10:45.944
SHIRORI'S ROOM
Resorting to extreme measures already!

10:46.607 --> 10:48.807
Which route won't get me caught?

10:49.451 --> 10:49.887
Hmph.

10:50.064 --> 10:52.966
No wonder they call you
a fake older brother.

10:52.967 --> 10:53.597
Huh?

10:54.047 --> 10:55.016
SISCON BROTHER
What does it mean?

10:55.017 --> 10:56.306
SISCON BROTHER
For a real older brother,

10:56.307 --> 10:59.306
winning over his little sister
is a piece of cake.

10:59.307 --> 11:01.747
So you think you could do better?

11:01.897 --> 11:03.146
Of course.

11:03.147 --> 11:06.905
The secret to winning someone over
is careful observation.

11:07.647 --> 11:08.407
Oh.

11:08.617 --> 11:12.616
First, disguise yourself so
the target doesn't notice.

11:12.617 --> 11:13.177
Yeah.

11:13.397 --> 11:17.496
Get as close as possible to record all
the daily activities of the target.

11:17.497 --> 11:18.306
Uh huh.

11:18.307 --> 11:22.417
Then analyze those records to find out
the target's interests and mindset.

11:22.567 --> 11:23.876
I see.

11:23.877 --> 11:25.647
Then can you try it out right away?

11:31.281 --> 11:32.126
Welcome back.

11:32.127 --> 11:33.806
Be careful, Kitahara.

11:33.807 --> 11:36.626
I heard there's a stalker around here
following Shiori.

11:36.627 --> 11:37.846
Ah...

11:37.847 --> 11:39.227
Oh, I see.

11:39.527 --> 11:41.646
Now what? Going to turn yourself in?

11:41.647 --> 11:43.367
It wasn't me!

11:43.947 --> 11:46.166
<i>Welcome to your inn.</i>

11:46.167 --> 11:47.186
That was when

11:47.187 --> 11:50.046
I was observing her through
my camera lens from the shadows.

11:50.047 --> 11:51.406
Did you look in the mirror?

11:51.407 --> 11:54.077
I told you it wasn't me!

12:02.667 --> 12:04.626
And thus, a pervert was discovered.

12:04.627 --> 12:06.376
Meaning there are two perverts?

12:06.377 --> 12:08.086
Why did a second one suddenly pop up?

12:08.087 --> 12:11.046
But if we just report to the police,
it'll be fine.

12:11.047 --> 12:12.657
Like hell it's that simple!

12:13.277 --> 12:16.726
That was just the observation phase.
Executing it is a different story.

12:16.727 --> 12:19.896
Oh, spoken like a true criminal.

12:19.897 --> 12:20.976
Stop it.

12:20.977 --> 12:23.337
Now is not the time to praise me.

12:23.647 --> 12:27.067
They will use the investigated info
to approach her.

12:27.547 --> 12:30.777
We must get rid of that pervert
before that happens!

12:30.927 --> 12:33.447
But how do we identify who they are?

12:33.607 --> 12:35.616
I'm counting on you for that.

12:35.617 --> 12:36.447
Why me?

12:37.737 --> 12:40.117
Birds of a feather flock together, right?

12:40.277 --> 12:41.557
You bastard!

12:42.127 --> 12:44.707
If it's that easy to find,
I wouldn't be struggling...

12:51.040 --> 12:52.966
Still no sign of anything unusual.

12:52.967 --> 12:54.266
How could that be?

12:54.267 --> 12:57.466
In your eyes, is that scene not unusual?

12:57.467 --> 12:58.677
What are you on about?

12:59.477 --> 13:01.556
The hot spring is so relaxing.

13:01.557 --> 13:02.436
Thank you.

13:02.437 --> 13:03.907
I'm glad to hear that.

13:06.017 --> 13:07.146
So cute!

13:07.147 --> 13:08.777
That's right.

13:10.357 --> 13:11.526
Take this.

13:11.527 --> 13:14.297
BLUE SPRING KIRARA COSPLAY
KIDS SIZE

13:17.287 --> 13:19.196
Please wear this, my lady.

13:19.197 --> 13:21.287
Surely your beauty will shine brighter.

13:22.277 --> 13:23.326
It can't be helped.

13:23.327 --> 13:24.746
Gotta save her.

13:24.747 --> 13:25.537
Yeah.

13:26.947 --> 13:28.477
Huh, what's wrong?

13:28.647 --> 13:30.377
Wait a minute.

13:30.497 --> 13:31.606
Now what?

13:31.607 --> 13:33.157
Though I wish to save her...

13:33.297 --> 13:34.557
I really do, but...

13:36.567 --> 13:41.137
My soul is cheering for those two!

13:42.347 --> 13:44.597
You also want
to see her in that outfit, right?

13:45.157 --> 13:48.607
If she hates you for ignoring this,
that's on you.

13:50.387 --> 13:53.776
What kind of brother
can't protect his own sister.

13:53.777 --> 13:55.537
You're just a complete stranger.

13:55.967 --> 13:57.357
Hey, you two.

13:58.757 --> 14:00.476
That's enough.

14:00.477 --> 14:02.497
You're bothering them.

14:08.337 --> 14:09.666
Hey kids!

14:09.667 --> 14:11.836
Want to compete again?

14:11.837 --> 14:15.546
- Drink! Drink!
- These two...

14:15.547 --> 14:17.377
are really pushing their luck.

14:18.681 --> 14:20.697
Ah, there is a cop over there!

14:21.097 --> 14:22.227
- Damn it!
- Police!

14:22.477 --> 14:23.766
Shit!

14:23.767 --> 14:24.807
Stop right there!

14:25.437 --> 14:26.897
Are you okay, Shiori?

14:27.123 --> 14:28.456
Yes, thank you.

14:28.457 --> 14:30.697
Thank you for saving us.

14:31.947 --> 14:34.037
It was nothing.

14:34.327 --> 14:37.237
Still, it was dangerous without me here.

14:37.367 --> 14:38.337
That's right.

14:38.477 --> 14:42.197
Times like this show that
siblings must help each other.

14:42.359 --> 14:43.467
You're right.

14:44.315 --> 14:45.716
So, about the passport...

14:45.717 --> 14:46.587
No way.

14:49.604 --> 14:51.047
Why not?

14:51.242 --> 14:52.897
I went out of my way to save her!

14:53.597 --> 14:55.766
That stubbornness is also great.

14:55.767 --> 14:57.547
It's not great at all.

14:57.887 --> 14:58.596
What else...

14:58.597 --> 14:59.507
Um...

15:01.267 --> 15:02.507
Are you...

15:02.617 --> 15:04.387
a friend of those guys?

15:04.494 --> 15:05.237
Yes.

15:05.447 --> 15:08.307
I'm Karina, their club mate.

15:08.832 --> 15:11.246
It seems they caused trouble for
you guys just now.

15:11.247 --> 15:14.237
Ah, well... it's fine with us...

15:14.717 --> 15:16.106
AFRAID OF STRANGERS
But causing trouble for Shiori

15:16.107 --> 15:17.276
AFRAID OF FOREIGNERS
is unacceptable.

15:17.277 --> 15:19.117
Oh, I'm really sorry.

15:19.407 --> 15:22.576
Both of them are huge
fans of Japanese women.

15:22.577 --> 15:25.907
I have to admit they do look
interested in Shiori and Chisa.

15:26.337 --> 15:29.417
They are especially obsessed with
Kirara Yoimachi.

15:30.377 --> 15:32.377
Kirara? What is that?

15:32.597 --> 15:34.796
KIRARA YOIMACHI
The little sister character in Blue Spring.

15:34.797 --> 15:36.266
KINDERGARTNER-INN MANAGER
I've also thought

15:36.267 --> 15:38.347
A LITTLE SISTER IN A PAST LIFE
Shiori-chan looks a lot like her.

15:38.787 --> 15:41.637
I will give them a stern warning.

15:41.857 --> 15:43.066
I'm counting on you.

15:43.067 --> 15:45.517
At this rate,
they might sneak into her room.

15:45.677 --> 15:47.667
I sincerely apologize.

15:47.757 --> 15:49.567
Then we'll take our leave.

15:51.332 --> 15:53.436
Alright, now to Shiori's room.

15:53.437 --> 15:54.817
Eh, what's wrong?

15:55.687 --> 15:58.237
I think I dropped the map of the inn somewhere.
SHIORI'S ROOM

15:58.339 --> 15:58.776
What did you say!?
SHIORI'S ROOM

15:58.777 --> 15:59.777
What did you say!?

15:59.967 --> 16:04.036
If they pick it up,
my sister will be in danger!

16:04.037 --> 16:06.247
She's not your sister.

16:07.077 --> 16:07.786
Huh?

16:07.787 --> 16:09.037
Let's go, Kitahara!

16:09.347 --> 16:11.907
To rescue
my little sister who is in danger...

16:12.017 --> 16:13.176
Why are you stopping me?

16:13.177 --> 16:15.586
This is dangerous for Shiori, right?

16:15.587 --> 16:17.716
That's why we need to go immediately!

16:17.717 --> 16:19.757
If that's the case...

16:20.227 --> 16:24.137
isn't this the perfect opportunity
to score points with her?

16:24.657 --> 16:25.557
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 3
You animal...

16:26.977 --> 16:28.977
KITAHARA INN

16:36.552 --> 16:37.652
W-Who's there?

16:37.653 --> 16:40.106
HEHEHE...
Hello, I am Tanaka.

16:40.107 --> 16:41.566
WE CAME TO PLAY WITH YOU, GIRLIE.
Hi, I'm Ken.

16:41.567 --> 16:43.236
BE GOOD.
Are you from Canada?

16:43.237 --> 16:45.406
WE WILL LOVE YOU, LITTLE SISTER.
No, I'm from America.

16:45.407 --> 16:46.696
<i>H</i>-<i>Hentai</i> (perverts)!

16:46.697 --> 16:47.906
Is anyone there?!

16:47.907 --> 16:49.157
Stop right there!

16:51.807 --> 16:54.496
Don't you dare touch
a single hair on Shiori's head!

16:54.497 --> 16:55.247
Big Brother!

17:00.057 --> 17:01.676
Are you okay, Shiori?

17:01.677 --> 17:03.707
Thank you so much.

17:04.037 --> 17:06.256
You are truly amazing, Big Brother.

17:06.257 --> 17:07.556
My ideal role model.

17:07.557 --> 17:09.137
Stop it.

17:09.535 --> 17:12.038
To repay you,
I will return your passport.

17:13.077 --> 17:14.582
That was the plan.

17:15.017 --> 17:16.477
How can you make it work.

17:16.717 --> 17:19.607
According to my analysis,
things will turn out this way.

17:20.647 --> 17:22.946
WE ARE LOLICONS
Ichiro plays tennis.

17:22.947 --> 17:25.027
NOW WE WILL DO PERVERT THINGS.
Hanako likes soccer.

17:25.787 --> 17:26.907
Wait!

17:28.257 --> 17:30.457
I will protect my little sister!

17:30.942 --> 17:31.933
Something like that.

17:32.477 --> 17:35.337
What were you originally
planning to do in Shiori's room?

17:36.087 --> 17:37.647
And naturally...

17:37.947 --> 17:40.756
Thank you so much, big brother Kouhei.

17:40.757 --> 17:43.007
It's nothing, don't worry about it.

17:43.287 --> 17:47.466
To repay this favor,
you can do whatever you want to me!

17:47.467 --> 17:48.887
Shiori!

17:50.143 --> 17:51.352
It'll turn out like that.

17:51.353 --> 17:54.396
You dare say those words
right in front of her brother?

17:54.397 --> 17:56.146
You're embarrassing me, idiot.

17:56.147 --> 17:59.776
Moreover, you should be helping me
get my passport back!

17:59.777 --> 18:02.127
My business with Shiori is more important!

18:03.977 --> 18:07.026
Can't be helped. Let's meet halfway.

18:07.027 --> 18:07.667
Yeah.

18:07.997 --> 18:10.446
I mean compromise.

18:10.447 --> 18:12.067
Compromise?

18:12.417 --> 18:14.666
Thank you both so much.

18:14.667 --> 18:15.636
You're welcome.

18:15.637 --> 18:17.307
Don't worry about it.

18:17.657 --> 18:19.706
Then, to repay this favor,

18:19.707 --> 18:22.507
you two can do whatever you want
with the passport.

18:23.057 --> 18:24.966
If you're fine with that, then whatever.

18:24.967 --> 18:27.467
Did the hot spring
boil your brain, you idiot?

18:28.177 --> 18:30.886
The problem is whether
they will actually come or not.

18:30.887 --> 18:32.597
I guarantee that.

18:32.817 --> 18:34.596
If they like Kirara Yoimachi,

18:34.597 --> 18:37.017
there's no way
they wouldn't be into Shiori.

18:37.107 --> 18:40.067
But, does she really look that similar?

18:40.757 --> 18:43.406
Yeah, you could call her
the real-life version...

18:43.407 --> 18:44.807
KIRARA

18:45.897 --> 18:48.506
Kotegawa looks similar too,
but she's a bit too old.

18:48.507 --> 18:51.656
Wait, first of all,
there's a problem with my clothes.

18:51.657 --> 18:53.486
Where's the outfit you wore here?

18:53.487 --> 18:55.035
I can't find them anywhere.

18:55.307 --> 18:57.376
Then you have no choice
but to wear that.

18:57.377 --> 18:59.546
Absolutely not!

18:59.547 --> 19:01.767
Whose idea was this in the first place?

19:04.297 --> 19:06.296
Wait, my daddy.

19:06.297 --> 19:08.006
What is it, my son?

19:08.007 --> 19:09.756
Hurry up and change then come out.

19:09.757 --> 19:12.016
There's something wrong with this outfit!

19:12.017 --> 19:13.726
Give me my clothes back!

19:13.727 --> 19:15.506
Do you hate that outfit that much?

19:15.507 --> 19:17.397
Of course I hate it.

19:17.657 --> 19:18.607
I see.

19:18.998 --> 19:21.397
Then I has no choice
but to wear it with you.

19:21.547 --> 19:22.356
What?

19:22.357 --> 19:24.317
Did you hit your head on something?

19:24.577 --> 19:27.276
Why do you want to dress up
like Kirara Yoimachi?

19:27.277 --> 19:28.037
Yeah.

19:28.497 --> 19:30.797
Earlier, the guest in the lobby said...

19:31.067 --> 19:33.337
Please don't do that, sir.

19:33.467 --> 19:34.337
What's wrong?

19:34.777 --> 19:36.736
Actually, I really...

19:36.737 --> 19:37.446
Wear it. Wear it.

19:37.447 --> 19:40.287
want to refuse these guests,
but I can't be rude.

19:40.667 --> 19:41.776
Hmm...

19:41.777 --> 19:43.086
I understand.

19:43.087 --> 19:44.767
Leave it to me.

19:45.427 --> 19:48.326
So I asked Iori,
who shares the same genes as Shiori.

19:48.327 --> 19:49.406
I see.

19:49.407 --> 19:51.827
The crucial thing is
we're different genders!

19:52.337 --> 19:54.636
Put that aside. Shiori is in danger!

19:54.637 --> 19:56.887
PLEASE DO NOT RUN IN THE HALLWAYS
What a hopeless bunch of scoundrels!

19:57.967 --> 19:59.947
Shiori-chan, are you okay?

20:00.047 --> 20:01.177
You guys.

20:03.877 --> 20:04.517
Huh?

20:04.647 --> 20:06.677
Why are they asleep?

20:06.937 --> 20:09.246
I don't understand
what's going on either.

20:09.247 --> 20:10.976
Anyway, it's good that you're safe.

20:10.977 --> 20:12.107
I was really worried.

20:12.257 --> 20:14.417
Thank you for your concern.

20:14.697 --> 20:18.407
But if you're so worried about me
you should just come live at home.

20:18.777 --> 20:19.936
Absolutely not.

20:19.937 --> 20:21.337
I'll pass on that.

20:21.837 --> 20:24.667
But brother Kouhei is always
ready to come live here.

20:25.067 --> 20:28.087
Brother Kouhei is more suited
to the urban life.

20:28.257 --> 20:31.717
It's true that the countryside
broadcasts fewer anime.

20:32.707 --> 20:34.636
You can just watch it online.

20:34.637 --> 20:35.657
This is...

20:37.197 --> 20:39.397
A towel soaked in...

20:40.977 --> 20:41.977
chloroform...

20:43.888 --> 20:44.387
Huh?

20:45.126 --> 20:46.606
My old man is sleeping too.

20:46.607 --> 20:47.926
Since when?

20:47.927 --> 20:50.607
Probably exhausted from working all day.

20:51.237 --> 20:53.866
Anyway, nothing happened this time.

20:53.867 --> 20:56.616
But having guests like this
is too dangerous.

20:56.617 --> 20:57.537
That's true.

20:57.707 --> 21:01.866
But don't worry. I'll protect you tonight.

21:01.867 --> 21:02.937
That's a relief.

21:03.037 --> 21:05.796
From now on, you'll always
be by my side, right?

21:05.797 --> 21:08.166
Ah no, I still have to go to school.

21:08.167 --> 21:11.507
No, you don't. You're not
suited for studying anyway.

21:12.977 --> 21:15.907
Kouhei, quickly steer the conversation!

21:16.217 --> 21:17.176
<i>Understood.</i>

21:17.177 --> 21:19.686
Oh, so that's how it is.

21:19.687 --> 21:21.226
What's wrong, Kouhei?

21:21.227 --> 21:26.106
There's a possibility they're faking
sleep to to strike late at night!

21:26.107 --> 21:28.136
What did you say!?

21:28.137 --> 21:29.066
Damn it!

21:29.067 --> 21:31.146
Now matter how cute she is...

21:31.147 --> 21:35.367
At this rate,
Shiori-chan will be in danger!

21:35.996 --> 21:36.760
Glance.

21:37.547 --> 21:39.616
So what should we do?

21:39.617 --> 21:44.537
The only way is to ask someone strong,
smart, and reliable to protect her.

21:44.677 --> 21:45.517
Glance.

21:45.987 --> 21:49.336
Tonight they will definitely
sneak into Shiori's room.

21:49.337 --> 21:50.467
No doubt about it.

21:50.747 --> 21:55.176
Because they have an infiltration map
drawn by Kitahara himself.

21:55.177 --> 21:56.366
Exactly.

21:56.367 --> 21:58.257
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

21:58.587 --> 22:01.477
In short,
you'll be in danger tonight.

22:01.977 --> 22:03.137
Is that so?

22:03.683 --> 22:05.456
What should we do, big brother?

22:06.197 --> 22:07.606
<i>Awesome.</i>

22:07.607 --> 22:08.806
<i>She took the bait.</i>

22:08.807 --> 22:10.627
<i>Everything is lining up.</i>

22:11.117 --> 22:13.987
<i>Now the passport is within my grasp.</i>

22:19.627 --> 22:21.247
<i>3... 2... 1... Go!</i>

22:30.797 --> 22:33.546
<i>A sweet little love story!?</i>

22:33.547 --> 22:36.336
<i>Asymmetrical reflection in the mirror</i>

22:36.337 --> 22:37.926
<i>A shattered, crunchy heart</i>

22:37.927 --> 22:40.007
<i>Oh oh, stumbling around</i>

22:40.557 --> 22:42.976
<i>Oh oh, just acting on instinct</i>

22:42.977 --> 22:46.936
<i>Diving deep into my subconscious</i>

22:46.937 --> 22:48.726
<i>Tumbling and falling down</i>

22:48.727 --> 22:51.276
<i>A limit-breaking paradise</i>

22:51.277 --> 22:52.526
<i>Viva, cheers</i>

22:52.527 --> 22:53.986
<i>Everyone, cheers</i>

22:53.987 --> 22:56.066
<i>We're in trouble, we're in trouble</i>

22:56.067 --> 22:56.776
<i>Big trouble</i>

22:56.777 --> 22:58.776
<i>We're in trouble, we're in trouble</i>

22:58.777 --> 22:59.576
<i>Wa wa wa</i>

22:59.577 --> 23:01.536
<i>We're in trouble, we're in trouble</i>

23:01.537 --> 23:02.246
<i>Wa wa wa wa</i>

23:02.247 --> 23:04.206
<i>Let's go, everybody</i>

23:04.207 --> 23:07.666
<i>Dramatic just like a rainbow</i>

23:07.667 --> 23:10.706
<i>Your troubled smile
is absolutely priceless</i>

23:10.707 --> 23:15.966
<i>Total chaos
getting kissed by an octopus</i>

23:15.967 --> 23:18.716
<i>A mermaid washed up on the shore</i>

23:18.717 --> 23:21.676
<i>Darling drowned down
in the Dragon Palace</i>

23:21.677 --> 23:26.936
<i>The treasure box is just full of alcohol</i>

23:26.937 --> 23:29.646
<i>The ultimate license of our youth</i>

23:29.647 --> 23:32.646
<i>Find the treasure and checkmate</i>

23:32.647 --> 23:37.856
<i>An angel who overslept
from swimming too much</i>

23:37.857 --> 23:39.316
<i>Let's go, everybody</i>

23:39.317 --> 23:40.696
<i>Viva, cheers</i>

23:40.697 --> 23:42.026
<i>Oh yeah</i>

23:42.027 --> 23:43.471
<i>Viva, cheers</i>

23:44.947 --> 23:49.957
